"table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 426.6171875, 191.75, 438.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 453.4765625, 546.75, 481.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 497.4765625, 546.75, 525.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七节 确认网络与业务访问\n\nVPN显示已连接但目标系统无法打开时，应记录目标系统名称、错误提示和发生时间。可以区分为网页无法访问、页面能够打开但登录失败、登录后缺少某项业务功能等不同现象，便于确认网络和业务权限问题。\n\n不应把“没有导出权限”等业务角色限制理解为VPN故障。例如某产品功能仅管理员可用时，网络连通并不能替代角色授权。相关产品权限应查阅对应产品", "rrf_score": 0.030798, "bm25_score": 6.161599, "vector_score": 0.454369}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十二条 权限和故障"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 157.25, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 654.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十二条 权限和故障\n\n系统无法上传附件或提交单据时，应记录发生时间、错误提示及申请单号，向内部服务渠道反馈。不要提供账号密码或验证码。技术故障本身不构成延期批准；本文没有规定故障期间的线下替代入口和期限豁免。", "rrf_score": 0.029958, "bm25_score": 3.411191, "vector_score": 0.486543}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c011", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r011", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十一节 允许提供的排查材料"], "token_count": 227, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 461.6171875, 203.25, 473.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 488.4765625, 541.5, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 560.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十一节 允许提供的排查材料\n\n工单可以包含企业账号标识、客户端显示的错误文字、发生时间、网络类型、目标系统名称以及已经尝试的排查步骤。截图应遮盖无关个人信息、其他系统业务数据和登录凭据，保留与错误相关的区域。\n\n不要提供密码、动态验证码、恢复码或完整的业务数据库内容。日志应通过企业确认的渠道提交，本文未授权把内部日志上传到公开网盘或论坛。需要更详细日志时，", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 1.732052, "vector_score": 0.474436}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c017", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r017", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十七节 开通与登录问答"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 180.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十七节 开通与登录问答\n\n问：提交申请后能立即登录吗？答：需等待审批和实际开通，本文不承诺处理时长。问：审批通过后使用什么登录？答：企业账号和动态验证码。问：可以让同事把验证码发给我代登吗？答：不要向他人分享验证码，应使用本人账号。\n\n问：客户端显示已连接，为什么仍无法使用某项产品功能？答：连接成功不等于业务角色授权，应核对目标系统权限。问：能否在任意个人", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 5.689333, "vector_score": 0.432448}]}}
